{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as various giant monsters, or as the heroes attempting to defeat them in this asymmetric two player local co-op VR fighting game. Send forth minions and swing massive weapons  or rocket jump around the stage and strike at them as they attempt to take you down!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Hero | PC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demolitionist\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Blast through the battlefield with rocket jumps and raining explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue</strong> \u2013 Swing across the arena with a grappling hook and strike fast with deadly daggers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mage</strong> \u2013 Bend reality, unleash devastating spells, whilst blinking across the map.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Villain | VR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lich King\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Hurl searing fireballs, summon spectral skulls, and unleash devastating magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The False Angel\u00a0</strong>\u2013Conjure holy weapons, summon starfall, and skewer your enemies with divine spikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Festering Hive </strong>\u2013 Command swarms of insects, choke the battlefield in vile toxins, and overwhelm all who oppose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of unique <strong>Heroes</strong> and <strong>Villains</strong>, each with their own abilities and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience thrilling <strong>asymmetric battles</strong> between VR and PC players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>expanded combat mechanics</strong> that push the limits of typical asymmetric VR fighting games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in a <strong>destructible environment</strong> where every blast leaves its mark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a striking <strong>2.5D art style</strong> unlike anything else.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3653680?t=1770663541","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3653680?t=1770663541","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653680/5d63c7dfe0ed88ad302bbc9ad7a29fa5806c9e8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770663541","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653680/5d63c7dfe0ed88ad302bbc9ad7a29fa5806c9e8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770663541","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4336150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as various giant monsters, or as the heroes attempting to defeat them in this asymmetric two player local co-op VR fighting game. Send forth minions and swing massive weapons  or rocket jump around the stage and strike at them as they attempt to take you down!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Hero | PC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demolitionist\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Blast through the battlefield with rocket jumps and raining explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue</strong> \u2013 Swing across the arena with a grappling hook and strike fast with deadly daggers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mage</strong> \u2013 Bend reality, unleash devastating spells, whilst blinking across the map.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Villain | VR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lich King\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Hurl searing fireballs, summon spectral skulls, and unleash devastating magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The False Angel\u00a0</strong>\u2013Conjure holy weapons, summon starfall, and skewer your enemies with divine spikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Festering Hive </strong>\u2013 Command swarms of insects, choke the battlefield in vile toxins, and overwhelm all who oppose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of unique <strong>Heroes</strong> and <strong>Villains</strong>, each with their own abilities and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience thrilling <strong>asymmetric battles</strong> between VR and PC players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>expanded combat mechanics</strong> that push the limits of typical asymmetric VR fighting games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in a <strong>destructible environment</strong> where every blast leaves its mark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a striking <strong>2.5D art style</strong> unlike anything else.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Mikko Anttila","Jesper Sarin","Marius Larilahti"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653680/d2e3cc860bad5d66b5ce30f77b17b729b77a9623/header.jpg?t=1770663541","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> <br></li><